{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "task_family": "incremental_english_modern_japanese_overlay",
  "book_id": "genji-modern",
  "chunk_id": "genji-modern-chunk-4613",
  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "匂亲王遵照薰君指点，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Prince Niou followed Lord Kaoru's directions,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "走近上次薰君进入的门口，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and went up to the doorway where Kaoru had entered last time,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "把扇子拍两下，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "then tapped his fan twice,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "弁君以为是薰君，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Ben no Kimi thought it was Lord Kaoru,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "就走出来引导他。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and came out to guide him in.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "匂亲王推想这老侍女是以前习惯于引导薰君的，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Prince Niou guessed that the old gentlewoman was used to guiding Kaoru before,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "心中觉得好笑，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and found it amusing in his heart,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "就跟着她走进二女公子房中去了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "so he followed her into the second princess's room.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 9,
      "source_text": "大女公子全不知情，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The elder princess knew nothing of this,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 10,
      "source_text": "正在敷衍薰君，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and was still trying to put Kaoru off,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 11,
      "source_text": "劝导他到妹妹房中去呢。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "urging him to go to her younger sister's room.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 12,
      "source_text": "薰君觉得可笑而又可怜。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Kaoru found it both amusing and pitiable.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 13,
      "source_text": "他想：“我严守秘密，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "He thought, I have kept the secret strictly,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 14,
      "source_text": "不让她知道，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and have not let her know,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 15,
      "source_text": "将来她埋怨我，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "but if she reproaches me later,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 16,
      "source_text": "教我罪无可逭。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "my guilt will be inescapable.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 17,
      "source_text": "便对她说道：“此次我来，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "So he said to her, This time I came here,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 18,
      "source_text": "匂亲王定要跟我同来，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "because Prince Niou insisted on coming with me,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 19,
      "source_text": "我未便拒绝。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and I could not very well refuse him.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 20,
      "source_text": "他已经来了，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "He has already arrived,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 21,
      "source_text": "并且已在不知不觉之间",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and before anyone noticed,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 22,
      "source_text": "悄悄地混进令妹房中去了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "he quietly slipped into your younger sister's room.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 23,
      "source_text": "想必是央求那个好事的弁君带他进去的吧。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "He must have begged that meddlesome Ben no Kimi to take him in.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 24,
      "source_text": "这样一来，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "With things turned out like this,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 25,
      "source_text": "我两头落空，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I have lost on both sides,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 26,
      "source_text": "成了世人的笑柄！”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and have become the laughingstock of the world.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 27,
      "source_text": "大女公子一闻此言，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "As soon as the elder princess heard these words,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 28,
      "source_text": "更觉出乎意外，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "she was even more shocked by the unexpected news,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 29,
      "source_text": "吓得两眼昏黑，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and was so frightened that her vision went dark,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 30,
      "source_text": "对他说道：“我想不到你如此心怀叵测，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and she said to him, I never imagined you could be so malicious,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 31,
      "source_text": "诡计多端，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "so full of schemes,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 32,
      "source_text": "以致屡次上你的当。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "that I have been deceived by you again and again.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 33,
      "source_text": "你欺侮我们！”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "You are taking advantage of us.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 34,
      "source_text": "其痛苦不可言喻。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Her suffering was beyond words.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 35,
      "source_text": "薰君答道：“今已无可奈何了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Kaoru answered, There is nothing to be done now.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 36,
      "source_text": "你生气是理之当然，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "It is only natural that you are angry,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 37,
      "source_text": "我要向你深表道歉。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and I must offer you my deepest apology.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 38,
      "source_text": "如果不够，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "If that is not enough,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 39,
      "source_text": "请你抓我，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "please seize me,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 40,
      "source_text": "拧我吧。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and twist my arm if you like.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 41,
      "source_text": "你爱慕那个身份高贵的匂亲王。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "You admire that noble Prince Niou.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 42,
      "source_text": "然而宿缘早就注定，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Yet ties from past lives were fixed long ago,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 43,
      "source_text": "不是可以随心所欲的。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and are not something one can arrange as one wishes.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 44,
      "source_text": "匂亲王钟情于令妹，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Prince Niou has given his heart to your younger sister,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 45,
      "source_text": "我很替你惋惜。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and I feel very sorry for you.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 46,
      "source_text": "但我自己夙愿未遂，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "But my own long-cherished wish has not been fulfilled,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 47,
      "source_text": "置身无地，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and I have nowhere to place myself,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 48,
      "source_text": "实甚伤心。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "which grieves me deeply.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 49,
      "source_text": "还是请你相信这是宿世姻缘，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Please believe that this is a bond from a former life,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 50,
      "source_text": "把心肠软下来吧。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and soften your heart.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 51,
      "source_text": "这纸门的间隔能有多少坚固，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "How firm can the barrier of this paper door really be,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 52,
      "source_text": "真正相信我俩关系清白的人，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and as for anyone who would truly believe our relationship is innocent,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 53,
      "source_text": "是不会有的。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "there will be no such person.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 54,
      "source_text": "央我引导来此的匂亲王心中，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Even Prince Niou, who begged me to guide him here,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 55,
      "source_text": "也决不会相信我今夜是如此苦闷直到天明的吧。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "surely will never believe that I suffered like this tonight until dawn.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 56,
      "source_text": "看他的样子，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Judging from his manner,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 57,
      "source_text": "似将拉破纸门而闯入室内。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "he seemed about to tear through the paper door and force his way into the room.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 58,
      "source_text": "大女公子痛苦不堪，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The elder princess could hardly bear her distress,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 59,
      "source_text": "心念还是敷衍一下，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and thought she should somehow humor him for now,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 60,
      "source_text": "哄他回去，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and coax him into leaving,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 61,
      "source_text": "便镇静下来，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "so she composed herself,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 62,
      "source_text": "对他说道：“你所说的宿世姻缘，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and said to him, The bond from a former life that you speak of,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 63,
      "source_text": "是眼睛所看不到的。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "is something the eyes cannot see.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 64,
      "source_text": "我命如何，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "What will become of my life,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 65,
      "source_text": "不得而知，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I cannot know,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 66,
      "source_text": "但觉‘前路茫茫悲堕泪’，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "but I feel only that the road ahead is dark and sad tears fall,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 67,
      "source_text": "眼前一片模糊而已。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and everything before my eyes is blurred.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 68,
      "source_text": "你将怎样对付我呢？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "What are you going to do with me?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 69,
      "source_text": "我真像做个噩梦！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "It is truly as if I were having a nightmare.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 70,
      "source_text": "如果后世有人把我当作话柄，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "If people in later ages make me a topic of gossip,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 71,
      "source_text": "定将同古代小说一样，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "they will surely treat it like an old tale,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 72,
      "source_text": "夸张其事，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "exaggerating what happened,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 73,
      "source_text": "无中生有，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "inventing things out of nothing,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 74,
      "source_text": "把我说成一个地道的笨人呢。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and making me out to be a complete fool.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 75,
      "source_text": "你如此布置，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "With all these arrangements you have made,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 76,
      "source_text": "心中究竟作何打算？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "what exactly are you planning in your heart?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 77,
      "source_text": "使我无法推量。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I cannot even guess.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04613",
      "unit_index": 78,
